# Valgrind suppressions: musl-static allocator false positives.
# Static musl binaries make valgrind report "uninitialised value" inside musl's own
# malloc internals (enframe / alloc_slot / alloc_group / __libc_malloc_impl) -- a
# well-known musl+valgrind artifact, NOT a DSFB defect. These match any such error
# originating in the musl allocator (any error kind, any caller). See README.md.
{
   musl-enframe
   Memcheck:Cond
   fun:enframe
   ...
}
{
   musl-enframe-val
   Memcheck:Value8
   fun:enframe
   ...
}
{
   musl-alloc-slot
   Memcheck:Cond
   fun:alloc_slot
   ...
}
{
   musl-alloc-group
   Memcheck:Cond
   fun:alloc_group
   ...
}
{
   musl-malloc-impl
   Memcheck:Cond
   fun:__libc_malloc_impl
   ...
}
